OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warned a day before Dover
OL,4,Aprotest, force says
OL,5,
OL,6,FKent Police says it was made aware of
OL,7,Fthe potential for protests in Dover the
OL,8,Fday before they took place but
OL,9,Finformation "was not fully assessed".
OL,11,FA large group of men dressed in black
OL,12,Fand wearing balaclavas blocked access
OL,13,Fto the Port of Dover on Saturday
OL,14,Fmorning for several hours, with
OL,15,Fwitnesses hearing them chanting "stop
OL,16,Fthe boats".
OL,18,FA spokesperson for the force said that,
OL,19,Fafter reviewing its decision making,
OL,20,Fthe information "may have allowed the
OL,21,Fforce to consider its resourcing", but
OL,22,Fdid not share what it was told.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
