OL,3,GNEWSAPolice warned a day before Dover
OL,4,Aprotest, force says
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers had previously admitted not
OL,7,Fknowing about the protest in advance,
OL,8,Fleading to accusations of a failure in
OL,9,Fintelligence-gathering.
